# Line endings.
#
# core.autocrlf is on, so without this every commit rewrites the files as
# CRLF and prints a warning per file. The sources are LF in the working tree;
# only a checkout to a Windows tool that wants CRLF should convert, and nothing
# in this project does, so the line ending is pinned instead of negotiated.
* text=auto eol=lf

# A test database or a WAL file is binary whatever its extension says.
*.db binary
*.db-wal binary
*.db-shm binary
*.db-journal binary
*.sqlite binary

# The vendored upstream suite keeps whatever it came with, and rewriting it
# would make a diff against upstream unreadable.
test/sqlite-suite/** -text
